  m_text: The player starts on a wall and must mimic the stance or movement shown
    on the next wall that appears. Each wall presents a specific dance pose, and
    the player must carefully observe and replicate it. The walls remain stationary,
    requiring precise movements to match the displayed figure accurately. The goal
    is to continue matching each pose as new walls appear while maintaining rhythm
    and accuracy.
