  m_text: Bronze, Silver, and Gold ranks represent performance levels based on the
    player's final score. A medal icon appears beside your score on the result canvas
    showing Bronze for basic performance, Silver for good execution, and Gold for
    excellent or near-perfect accuracy. Try to reach the Gold medal by hitting accurate
    moves and maintaining combos.
