      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "The game includes dance figures from Lerion and Cari\xF1osa. Lerion steps
    involve Libad, Kunday, Katok, Step Swing/Kamayan, Kawit, and Labas-Pasok, focusing
    on smooth movements. Cari\xF1osa features Three Steps and Point, Touch Step,
    Three-step Forward and Back to Back, Hide and Seek with Fan, Kneeling and Fanning,
    Hide and Seek with Handkerchief, Flirting with Handkerchief, and Flirting, highlighting
    expressive gestures."
