  m_text: "This tutorial provides a step-by-step guide to LerioSayaw for learning
    Philippine folk dances, specifically Lerion and Cari\xF1osa. The application
    offers an immersive and interactive environment where users can practice dance
    steps while integrating cultural education, ensuring a structured approach to
    preserving and learning traditional Filipino dances."
